# ACM Knowledge Database -- Format Templates

Use these templates when creating NEW knowledge files. When updating existing files, match the format already in the file.

## architecture/<subsystem>/architecture.md

```markdown
---
type: architecture
subsystem: <subsystem>
acm_version: "5.0"
last_verified: YYYY-MM-DD
related:
  - data-flow/<subsystem>/data-flow.md
  - health/<subsystem>/known-issues.md
  - failures/<subsystem>/failure-signatures.md
---

# <Subsystem Name> -- Architecture

## What <Subsystem Name> Does
<1-2 paragraph description>

---

## Key Components

### <component-name>
- **Pod label:** `app=<label>`
- **Namespace:** <namespace>
<What it does, 2-3 sentences>

---

## Cross-Subsystem Dependencies
| Dependency | Why |
|---|---|

## What Depends on <Subsystem Name>
| Consumer | Impact When Down |
|---|---|
```

