# <Area> Area Knowledge

## Overview
<1-2 sentences>

## Key Components
<Tables of components, CRDs>

## Navigation Routes
| Route Key | Path | Page |
|-----------|------|------|

## Testing Considerations
<Bullet list of gotchas, known issues, prerequisites>
```

